      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 327926e5d9194bf390c86b2a1fad3147
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A pack leader (alpha, warlord, command unit — any faction): the moment it has a target and its support is ready (EnemyData › Kit › Support: a Rally — speed and damage for every ally near it) it roars: the pack is rallied and radioed in. Otherwise it hunts as a Pack Hunter. Kill it and the pack falters (lead-loss morale).'
